Source code for this image
==========================

This image contains Squid (GPL-2.0-or-later) and other Alpine Linux packages,
several of them under the GPL or LGPL (busybox, for one, is GPL-2.0-only).

The complete corresponding source of every package in this image - Alpine's
build recipe and patches for each, the upstream source archives, and their
licence texts - is published beside it in the same registry, under the same tag
with "-source" appended:

    ghcr.io/toastedcoffee/bottlevault-egress:<tag>-source

For example, the source of ...:<commit-sha> is ...:<commit-sha>-source. Its
PACKAGES.tsv lists each package, version, licence and Alpine aports commit;
aports/ holds each package's build recipe and distfiles/ the source archives.
It is a data-only image, not something to run. To copy it out:

    docker pull ghcr.io/toastedcoffee/bottlevault-egress:<tag>-source
    id=$(docker create ghcr.io/toastedcoffee/bottlevault-egress:<tag>-source none)
    docker cp "$id":/source ./bottlevault-egress-source
    docker rm "$id"

The image's own files (the entrypoint, the SNI helper and the healthcheck
in /usr/local/bin) are BottleVault's, licensed AGPL-3.0-only; see LICENSE and
COPYRIGHT in this directory and https://github.com/toastedcoffee/BottleVault.
